# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Source corpus — never commit
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# This is the load-bearing section. NOTICE.md and README.md both state that the
# source material is not included in this repository: it was supplied by the
# commissioning party, and the underlying texts remain Liu Zhongjing's
# intellectual property. One careless `git add -A` from the directory holding
# the books would falsify that claim and publish them.
#
# The corpus this persona was distilled from — 《阿姨我不想努力了》,
# 《文明更迭的源代码》,《洼地与韭菜》,《中国洼地》, 陈医师访谈, and the 2020–2025
# lecture set — stays on the machine that ran the distillation.
*.pdf
*.epub
*.mobi
*.azw
*.azw3
*.djvu
*.doc
*.docx
*.rtf
*.odt
*.txt

corpus/
corpora/
sources/
source/
raw/
transcripts/
incoming/

# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Distillation run artifacts
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# If a fold-in is ever run from inside this repo, persona-distiller writes its
# work directory and intermediate JSON here. Those are scratch, not deliverables
# — the honesty ledger in references/provenance.md is what gets committed.
persona_work/
.persona_work/
work/

coverage_map.json
passages.json
extractions.json
scores.json
fidelity.json
manifest.json
split.json

